{
  "description": "sanitizePromptPartnerName (TS: API + Assist) and promptcatalog.SanitizeIdentityName (Go) must produce exactly `expected` for every `input`; null means \"use the generic name\". A spoofing control: plan Task 3.1, Review Focus 3.",
